  "title": "Finbar delivers robust FY25 Result",
  "summary": "We are pleased to announce a full-year Net Profit after Tax of $14.38 million for the financial year ended 30 June 2025. On an underlying basis, excluding yearly variations in property valuations and one-off disposals, underlying NPAT was $16.17 million, an improvement of 16% over the prior year.",
